        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "I will be performing some classic jazz, Latin and pop standards with my band at The Spirit of Hope United Church.  This show is a matinee performance (3:30pm - 5:00pm) on Sunday, April 19th and  is open to the public!  Cover charge is by donation."
